Of course, Alan, a good friend of Liza's.

00:00:37.677 --> 00:00:38.510
(Conan chuckling)

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:39.945
Huge. She's fantastic.

00:00:39.945 --> 00:00:40.778
And she's good.

00:00:40.778 --> 00:00:41.841
I've done a duet with Liza.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:42.674
Did you really?

00:00:42.674 --> 00:00:43.507
You did a duet?

00:00:43.507 --> 00:00:44.340
Mhm. Yeah we did two-

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:45.328
Was this at the garage?

00:00:45.328 --> 00:00:46.902
No, it was proper.

00:00:46.902 --> 00:00:47.735
