00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:50.903
Kind of.

00:00:50.903 --> 00:00:51.736
Yeah.

00:00:51.736 --> 00:00:52.569
Now I heard, I don't know if this is true,

00:00:52.569 --> 00:00:53.560
