00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:56.439
And I don't know what that means.

00:00:56.439 --> 00:00:57.630
Like, you're obsessed,
are you stalking him?

00:00:57.630 --> 00:00:58.660
Steve Harvey the comedian.

00:00:58.660 --> 00:00:59.960
What is it that you're obsessed with

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:00.793
about Steve Harvey?

00:01:00.793 --> 00:01:01.820
I have no idea.

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:05.699
I think he's so amazing looking.

00:01:05.699 --> 00:01:06.532
Mhm.

00:01:06.532 --> 00:01:07.365
First of all, whenever I see him,

00:01:07.365 --> 00:01:10.110
I don't know what it
is, but it fills me with

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:12.026
an immense sense of joy.

00:01:12.026 --> 00:01:13.188
(audience laughing)

00:01:13.188 --> 00:01:14.021
Like, its, uh-

00:01:14.021 --> 00:01:15.100
Just when you see Steve Harvey?

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:18.390
Its like, its like his hairline is perfect

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:21.134
and he's got that amazing mustache.

00:01:21.134 --> 00:01:22.040
Uh-huh.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.380
And he just looks like a, um,

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:25.380
