00:01:29.229 --> 00:01:30.062
Really?

00:01:30.062 --> 00:01:31.960
Yeah, I just always... Yeah, there he is!

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:33.901
Yeah, okay. I see what you're saying.

00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:36.005
(audience clapping)

00:01:36.005 --> 00:01:37.034
That makes me crazy.

00:01:37.034 --> 00:01:39.200
No, you're- You know what?

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.940
You were right. I was
feeling a little down

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:42.550
'cause its so cold out and everything.

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:44.030
I saw that picture - put it up again!

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:45.918
And I felt really good again, you know?

00:01:45.918 --> 00:01:46.987
Yeah.

00:01:46.987 --> 00:01:47.988
And it filled me with joy.

00:01:47.988 --> 00:01:49.922
(audience cheering)

00:01:49.922 --> 00:01:51.485
That's terrific.

00:01:51.485 --> 00:01:52.430
You know there would be no world war

00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:54.190
