00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:07.023
and harmony.

00:02:07.023 --> 00:02:08.140
And understanding.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:08.973
Yeah.

00:02:08.973 --> 00:02:09.806
Um,

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:11.757
I like to end that like Batman.

00:02:11.757 --> 00:02:13.800
"And understanding."

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.900
Now you on Saturday Night Live,

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:16.840
