00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:22.250
Its all going well for you.

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:23.321
Yeah.

00:02:23.321 --> 00:02:24.154
But there seems to be a pattern.

00:02:24.154 --> 00:02:25.560
It seems like they've pigeonholed you

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:27.190
