00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.803
Get Rudolph on the horn, she'll do it.

00:02:58.803 --> 00:03:00.160
Rudolph'll do it!

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:03.450
Its true. I have no
shame, and I will do it.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:05.990
You've done a lot. We
actually found a, uh,

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:06.960
